{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome !</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STARFORCE RANGERS is a small online space RPG in development.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655560/extras/0e2fa91d2e7150e46d5c6b8b4555d8c3.avif?t=1766062764\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- skill based, slow paced space combat </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- several dmg/buff/healing skills obtained through leveling </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- flyable free in 6 directions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- small instanced multiplayer areas </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- some masteries to spend points into </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- RPG leveling: approx. 40-50 levels with different shipclasses around every 10th level</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Content which (should) come later:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- generic delivery missions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- resource gatherinig</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- PVE group alerts/invitations to all players at certain time intervals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- PVP areas</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- time taking multi crafting of some of the ships' modules like lasers, rocketsystems, shields,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 armors with different specialization of each player to produce different tiers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- markets to sell your produced/gathered goods</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's open for playtesting right now. solo project.\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3655560?t=1766062764","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655560/539592a078543e13c91902442d912d664e0e5180/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=176606276